    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Pre-Purchase Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to play your friends in AquaBall?\u00a0 You got next!\u00a0 Get special rewards for your pre-purchase.\u00a0 We will send you the crowdfunding information also.\u00a0 Cheers!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the AquaBall League (ABL) The Ultimate Ocean Showdown!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete, explore, and complete epic quests to protect the seas, unlock power-ups, and become an AquaBall legend! Are you ready to dive in? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, in the crystal-clear waters of JamRock Bay, a young islander named Jay and his adventurous best friend, Odon the dolphin, dreamed of bringing the oceans fastest, smartest, and most agile creatures together for an electrifying new sport. With the help of their dolphin pod and a crew of marine champions, they created AquaBall League a high-speed, high-energy water sport where teamwork, skill, and oceanic instincts collide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the AquaBall League is a global sensation, with teams from every corner of the seven seas competing in 2v2 matches, using their natural abilities dolphin flips, octopus tentacle passes, squid ink defense, and more to score epic goals. Players train all year long for a chance to compete in the legendary annual playoffs, leading up to the most prestigious event of all:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(AquaBall League Championships) THE OCEAN BOWL CHAMPIONSHIPS\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Held in the breathtaking Arenas of Atlantis Prime, the Ocean Bowl is where only the best of the best battle for the Aqua Crown! From the mystical Shadalar Gardens to the treacherous waves of Poseidons Horn, every match is a test of speed, precision, and teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AquaBall League exposes our audience and community, to concepts of being eco-friendly citizens, promoting conservation, and creativity. In between matches, players embark on quests to clean up arenas, solve oceanic mysteries, and build new technology to protect marine life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, are you ready to dive in, make history, and become an AquaBall legend? The next Ocean Bowl is calling will you answer?\u00a0 You got next!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the AquaBall League (ABL) The Ultimate Ocean Showdown!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete, explore, and complete epic quests to protect the seas, unlock power-ups, and become an AquaBall legend! Are you ready to dive in? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, in the crystal-clear waters of JamRock Bay, a young islander named Jay and his adventurous best friend, Odon the dolphin, dreamed of bringing the oceans fastest, smartest, and most agile creatures together for an electrifying new sport. With the help of their dolphin pod and a crew of marine champions, they created AquaBall League a high-speed, high-energy water sport where teamwork, skill, and oceanic instincts collide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the AquaBall League is a global sensation, with teams from every corner of the seven seas competing in 2v2 matches, using their natural abilities dolphin flips, octopus tentacle passes, squid ink defense, and more to score epic goals. Players train all year long for a chance to compete in the legendary annual playoffs, leading up to the most prestigious event of all:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(AquaBall League Championships) THE OCEAN BOWL CHAMPIONSHIPS\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Held in the breathtaking Arenas of Atlantis Prime, the Ocean Bowl is where only the best of the best battle for the Aqua Crown! From the mystical Shadalar Gardens to the treacherous waves of Poseidons Horn, every match is a test of speed, precision, and teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AquaBall League exposes our audience and community, to concepts of being eco-friendly citizens, promoting conservation, and creativity. In between matches, players embark on quests to clean up arenas, solve oceanic mysteries, and build new technology to protect marine life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, are you ready to dive in, make history, and become an AquaBall legend? The next Ocean Bowl is calling will you answer?\u00a0 You got next!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "The Aquaball League is a fast-paced 2v2 water sport and adventurous multiplayer platformer, where players use the natural abilities of marine champions\u2014dolphin flips, squid ink defense, and octopus tentacle passes\u2014to score big!",
